OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil withdraws support for
OL,4,Afuture jobs fairs featuring British
OL,5,AArmy
OL,6,
OL,7,FDerry City and Strabane District
OL,8,FCouncil has voted to withdraw any
OL,9,Finvolvement in the organisation or
OL,10,Fmarketing of any future jobs fair that
OL,11,Fincludes the British Armed Forces.
OL,13,FProposed by Sinn Fein councillor
OL,14,FChristopher Jackson, the motion stated
OL,15,Fthat the presence of the British Armed
OL,16,FForces at a recent jobs fair organised
OL,17,Fby the Department for Communities (DfC)
OL,18,Fhad acted as a "barrier" for some
OL,19,Fpeople seeking employment
OL,20,Fopportunities.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
