PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1793264179
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil withdraws support for
OL,4,Afuture jobs fairs featuring British
OL,5,AArmy
OL,6,
OL,7,FJackson said the legacy of the Armed
OL,8,FForces in Londonderry had been one of
OL,9,F"trauma, hurt and destruction".
OL,11,FDUP councillor Niree McMorris said the
OL,12,Fmotion would limit employment
OL,13,Fopportunities and accused council of
OL,14,Fpoliticising employment opportunities.
